\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>INTUITIVE DESIGN<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">An extension of their green surroundings, Trident Residences are designed as pedestrianized realms and raised the ground on V-shaped pilotis. This allows residents to move seamlessly through the property&#8217;s beautiful landscapes. A pedestrian gate allows residents and guests to enter from the street. Vehicles are directed to an automated car park in the basement, with access from the rear of the site. The building&#8217;s architectural language has a distinctive elegance and contemporary minimalism of urban living.<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>THE LANDSCAPE<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The landscaped grounds preserve aged trees inherited with the site, which add a natural palette that celebrates seasonal variations. The perimeter walls of the ground floor are lined with vertical planters to complement the site&#8217;s landscape, purifying the air around its wooden seating decks and pedestrian pathways.<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>THE INTERIORS<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The neutral yet distinct treatment of the interiors provides the ideal setting for residents to personalise their homes with their own furniture, objets d&#8217;art, and artefacts. Each room receives ample natural light and ventilation. The bedrooms, bathrooms, family lounge, kitchen and living room frame uninterrupted views of the stadium&#8217;s landscaped gardens while ensuring privacy for its residents.<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>INVESTMENT HIGHLIGHT<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>PRIME LOCATION<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Nestled in the heart of New Delhi, a stone&#8217;s throw from Delhi Golf Club, Khan Market and The Oberoi, New Delhi.<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UNMATCHED PEDIGREE<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">First-ever living spaces fully serviced by the signature Trident hospitality.<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>LIMITED INVENTORY<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">21 apartments<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BIOPHILIC DESIGN<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Living bio walls line the perimeter of the property.<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>LANDSCAPED ROOFTOP<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Expansive terrace with water body and gardens.<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>OUTDOOR DECKS<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Wooded charm hewed from polished natural Ash wood.<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RESIDENTIAL SERVICES<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">CONCIERGE \/ LOBBY MANAGER<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">MEETING ROOMS<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">RESIDENTS&#8217; LOUNGE<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">WELL-APPOINTED FITNESS CENTRE<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">ACCESS TO ROOFTOP LOUNGE WITH SCREEN AND SEATING AREAS<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">LANDSCAPED GARDENS<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">TERRACED GARDENS<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">24-HOUR SECURITY WITH ACCESS CONTROL<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">CENTRALISED MAINTENANCE<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">FIRE AND LIFE SAFETY SYSTEMS<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>TRIDENT BRAND PROGRAMME &amp; SERVICES<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Trident Membership for apartment buyers<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">\r\n\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Reservation privileges for fami